{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24267","headline":"和杨同州寒食乾坑会後闻杨工部欲到知予与工部有宿酲 · 白居易","name":"和杨同州寒食乾坑会後闻杨工部欲到知予与工部有宿酲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜饮归常晚，朝眠起更迟。\n举头中酒後，引手索茶时。\n拂枕青长袖，欹簪白接䍦。\n宿酲无兴味，先是肺神知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}